 begin with you. The case is public. It's BP vs Buckler 1987\r\nChris: good morning sion\r\nSion Buckler: Good morning.\r\nChris: thank you for information,To allow me to help you, would you please provide the following information and confirm you are happy for this to be stored and shared within the relevant Royal British Legion departments?\r\n\r\nConsent: Yes/No \r\nFull Name:\r\nTelephone number:\r\nAddress:\r\nPost Code:\r\n \r\nSion Buckler: Yes. Requester. [redacted]. [redacted]. [redacted].\r\nSion Buckler: My old service ID: 25148537\r\nChris: thank you just bear with me a moment\r\nChris: Date of birth:\r\nNational Insurance Number: \r\nBranch of armed Forces: (Army, RAF, Navy, Marines)\r\nService number:\r\nRegiment:\r\nEnlistment Date:\r\nDischarge Date:\r\nName whilst Serving:\r\n \r\nSion Buckler: 24/10/1984 , Army. 25148537. Royal Signals. July 2002 - July 2007. Or there abouts. Name whilst serving: Requester Hywel Buckler (nickname: Noel)\r\nSion Buckler: NI number: JE340808A\r\nChris: thank you\r\nChris: just uploading this on\r\nChris: so what we can do today is pass this on to a case worker\r\nChris: who will be in touch to assist you futher on what you can with this]\r\nChris: how would you like be contacted please?\r\nSion Buckler: email: [redacted]\r\nChris: thank you\r\nChris: i pop on the notes contact you via email\r\nChris: anything else i can help you with today?\r\nSion Buckler: Thanks. That's all. Enjoy your week\r\nChris: saem you as you\r\nChris: \r\n\r\nThank you for contacting the Royal British Legion Advice and Information Line. Our Live Chat facility is open 8am till 8pm Monday to Sunday if you need any other assistance.\r\n\r\nAlternately you can contact us directly on 0808 802 8080 our lines are open 8am till 8pm Monday to Sunday.\r\n\r\n\r\nSystem: 'Requester' is currently 'Absent'. Approximately 120 seconds until disconnect.\r\nSystem: Concluded by Agent\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQuestion Reference # 251111-000063\r\n       Date C