ou need to contact Ordnance Survey regarding your request at any time, please quote the allocated reference number in your correspondence.\nMany thanks again and with kind regards,\nNikki\n\nNikki Osborne for the FOI Team\nLegal Services\n[cid:image003.png@01DD67B5.1BE4BDA0]\nAdanac Drive, Southampton, [postcode redacted], United Kingdom\n[email redacted] | www.os.uk<http://www.os.uk/>\nFollow us: X (Twitter)<https://x.com/OrdnanceSurvey> | LinkedIn<https://www.linkedin.com/company/ordnance-survey/> | YouTube<https://www.youtube.com/@ordnancesurvey/videos> | Instagram<https://www.instagram.com/ordnancesurvey/?hl=en> | Facebook<https://www.facebook.com/osmapping/>\n\n\n\nThis email"},{"id":"gm-1a18815b127f1aa5","subject":"RE: RC26-0375 (gan gynnwys RC26-0353, -0368, a -0371) - Ty Mawr/ Great House, Llandough, Cardiff - Further response","name":"RE: RC26-0375 (gan gynnwys RC26-0353, -0368, a -0371) - Ty Mawr/ Great House, Llandough, Cardiff - Further response","date":"2026-10-29T14:34:31Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-1a18815b127f1aa5.txt","threadSlug":"gt-1a11178b91ab138c-rc26-0375-gan-gynnwys-rc26-0353-0368-a-0371-ty-mawr-great-house-llandough-cardiff-further-response","scopeTopics":["rcahmw"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["rcahmw"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verified case correspondence); email addresses, phone numbers and private addresses redacted.","threadId":"gt-1a11178b91ab138c","direction":"received","from":"NMR Enquiries","institutions":[{"id":"rcahmw","name":"RCAHMW (Royal Commission)"}],"refs":["RC26-0375"],"jsonUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/api/message/gm-1a18815b127f1aa5.json","textStatus":"available","text":"Diolch am eich ymholiad. Byddwn yn ceisio ymateb cyn pen 15 diwrnod gwaith.  Rydym wedi gohirio ein gwasanaeth chwilio a blaenoriaeth ar hyn o bryd oherwydd prinder staff.  Ymddiheuriadau am unrhyw anghyfleustra a achosir.\nYn y cyfamser, gallai’r wybodaeth isod fod yn ddefnyddiol i chi:\nI gael gwybodaeth am safleoedd hanesyddol yng Nghymru a chael manylion am yr hyn sydd yn ein harchifau, ewch i’n cronfa ddata a’n catalog, https://coflein.gov.uk/cy/\nOs yn bosibl, rydym yn argymell eich bod yn trefnu apwyntiad i ymweld â’n llyfrgell ac ystafell chwilio<https://cbhc.gov.uk/gwasanaethau/> ein harchif, os hoffech weld deunydd yr archif â’ch llygaid eich hun a thynnu lluniau heb orfod talu amdanynt. Yn gyffredinol, mae gwneud hynny’n gynt ac yn rhatach o lawer nag archebu sganiau o bell.\nMae llawer o’n delweddau digidol ar gael i’w lawrlwytho, eu prynu a’u trwyddedu yn syth o Coflein. Mae canllawiau ynghylch sut mae gwneud hynny i’w gweld yn y fideo byr hwn: Lawrlwytho delweddau o Coflein<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JYJmCNrRFqY> Os nad yw’r ddelwedd yr ydych yn chwilio amdani ar gael drwy’r system hon, y rheswm am hynny’n aml fydd cyfyngiadau hawlfraint, ac efallai y byddwch am chwilio am ddelwedd amgen sydd ar gael, os yw hynny’n bosibl.\n\nThank you for your enquiry.  We will endeavour to respond within 15 working days.  Please note, we have currently suspended our Pr"},{"id":"gm-1a187f7e54601e73","subject":"Request for information - Ref: FOI2026/11260","name":"Request for information - Ref: FOI2026/11260","date":"2026-10-29T14:02:12Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-1a187f7e54601e73.txt","threadSlug":"gt-1a187f7e54601e73-quest-for-information-ref-foi2026-11260","scopeTopics":[],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":[],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's 