"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\">Dear Requester<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\">Thank you for your email dated 28 September 2026 at 22:40<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\">Do you have any Claim Number relating to the below?<br>\n<br>\nRegards<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">Neil Jones<u><o:p></o:p></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Adran Gorfodi / Enforcement Section<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">HMCTS/GLlTEM Canolfan Llysoedd Sifil Caerdydd / Cardiff Civil Justice Centre</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">2 Stryd y Parc / 2 Park Street</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Caerdydd / Cardiff<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">[postcode redacted] <br>\n<br>\nDX: 99500 CARDIFF 6 <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Ffon / Tel: </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">[phone redacted]</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/hm-courts-and-tribunals-service/about/personal-information-charter\">Here is how HMCTS uses personal data about you</a>\n | <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/hm-courts-and-tribunals-service/about/personal-information-charter.cy\">\nDyma sut mae GLlTEM yn defnyddio data personol amdanoch chi</a><u><span style=\"color:#0563C1\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><br>\n<br>\n“I am not authorised to bind the Ministry of Justice contractually, nor to make representations or other statements which may bind the Ministry of Justice in any way via electronic means”</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">YSTYRIWCH YR AMGYLCHEDD - OES RHAID I CHI BRINTIO'R E-BOST HWN?\n<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">PLEASE CONSIDER THE ENVIRONMENT - DO YOU REALLY NEED TO PRINT THIS E-MAIL?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">‘For information on how HMCTS uses personal data about you please see:\n<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Am wybodaeth ynghylch sut mae GLlTEF yn defnyddio data personol amdanoch chi, ewch i:\n<a href=\"http://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/hm-courts-and-tribunals-service/about/personal-information-charter\">\n<span style=\"color:#0563C1\">www.gov.uk/government/organisations/hm-courts-and-tribunals-service/about/personal-information-charter</span></a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"451\" height=\"199\" style=\"width:4.7013in;height:2.0763in\" id=\"Picture_x0020_1111233115\" src=\"cid:image001.png@01DD5D44.F0846270\"></span><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype id=\"_x0000_t75\" coordsize=\"21600,21600\" o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\" filled=\"f\" stroked=\"f\">\n<v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\" />\n<v:formulas>\n<v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\" />\n<v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\" />\n<v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\" />\n<v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\" />\n<v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\" />\n<v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\" />\n<v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\" />\n<v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\" />\n<v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\" />\n<v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\" />\n<v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\" />\n<v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\" />\n</v:formulas>\n<v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\" />\n<o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\" />\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"AutoShape_x0020_2\" o:spid=\"_x0000_s1026\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" style='width:24pt;height:24pt;visibility:visible;mso-left-percent:-10001;mso-top-percent:-