x;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\">\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#183247;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">In the regulations our staff time is valued at £25 per hour.  This has the effect of imposing a time limit of 18 hours of staff time for activities specified in the regulations.</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\">\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span><span style=\"color:#183247;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt\">The regulations make the following activities by an authority countable towards the cost limit.</span></p>\n</div>\n<ul style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\" type=\"disc\">\n<li style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">determining whether it holds the information,</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\" type=\"disc\">\n<li style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">locating the information, or a document which may contain the information,</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\" type=\"disc\">\n<li style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">retrieving the information, or a document which may contain the information, and</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\" type=\"disc\">\n<li style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">extracting the information from a document containing it.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\">\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span><span style=\"color:#183247;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt\">We have estimated the time and therefore costs as provided by the regulations, and in doing so have taken into account the above activities.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\">\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">We estimate that this work will take in excess of 18 hours</span><span style=\"color:#183247;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> of effort by our staff. As we have a significant amount of documents on file from the period 2002-2016 where minutes are in documents rather than published on the website or in archives. </span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\">\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span><span style=\"color:#183247;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt\">We estimate this will exceed the limit provided for by the regulations and therefore your request is refused on the grounds provided for under section 12 of the act.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#183247;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt\">Our estimate of time is based on the requirement to search all minutes of the council and its committees for a period of 14 years. It is estimated that it will take about 20 minutes to read each set of minutes of which there are estimated to 224 sets of minutes. It is considered that this is likely to take about 10 minutes to assess each set of minutes a total of over 2240 minutes which equates to 37 hours.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\">\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span><span style=\"color:#183247;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt\">We may may be able to provide some information if you are able to reduce or refine your request to bring the cost of compliance under the regulations limit.  We suggest that you could limit the time frame of minutes that we would need to look through. For example 2002-2006. </span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\">\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span><span style=\"color:#183247;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt\">Please contact us if you would like to refine your request.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\">\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span><span style=\"color:#183247;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt\">If you are not satisfied with this response or you wish to complain about any aspect of the handling of your request, then you should contact us in the first instance and we will undertake an internal review.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\">\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span><span style=\"color:#183247;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">If after the internal review you wish to complain further then you 