d and what is now church view close green —and\nParcel B: the eastern agricultural land, east of our Parcel A and what was\nWGR and BP's parcel and the focus on their possession. My argument is,\nagain - that our parcel of land and home since 1667, was treated as one and\nthe same as Parcel B under the blanket term \"whole farm\".\n\nOur Parcel A (or a synthetic mimic of it, born from a long running and\nrejected string of attempts to make our occupancy appear permissive) was\nstealthfully registered by BP in 1983 and merged into their Parcel B in\n1987 - my grandmother conveniently dying and no notice given of the\nregistration in the appeal window. Much like the 87 stealthful merge of\nparcels before my late fathers appeal of the 87 ruling concluded. Our\ncounty treasure home was also demolished in 88 before our appeal had even\nbegun, let alone concluded, of CADW's decision not to list it as a Grade II\nso it couldn't be demolished.\n\nSpell and grammar check. Also make it less abhorrent but don't lose any of\nwhat is being said or be apologetic. This is a statement of truth , my\ntruth. `None of this should be downgraded to a speculative theory simply\nbecause the Council has not adjudicated it. The chronology of evidence is\npainting a damning picture of what looks to be everything needed to reopen\nthis case I.e. fraud, concealment and government involvement. Which I am\ninvestigating and I would encourage you to all do your own research and\ninvestigate too.\n\n\nI'll give you the courtesy of some colloquialism before I revert back to\nprofessionalism with this communication so you have the courtesy from me of\nbeing treated like a human. And so you know you are also dealing with a\nhuman. I also got some very gracious emails from Chris Frank's and the\ncorriners and other family and community members who's families have been\nallied with my family for decades and even centuries here.\n\n\nFirstly I am whole heartedly rejecting this terrorist/ hostage\nsituationship with local authorities here. And our town and county and\ncountry, being turned into one giant corporate concentration work camp.\nWith voters being imported by traitors to keep themselves in power. I was\nunder Tony Blairs orders and I called David Cameron into an international\ntreaty I stopped (WCIT 2012), so I know a lot of the stuff the other\nmammals on this island get upto.\n\n\nWhat happened to our stronghold and the destruction of our ancient history\nand herritage and family is tandamount to ethnic cleansing and a\ndeclaration of war on all I hold sacred like my family, home, land,\nhistory, reality and faith. The situation was untenable enough back then,\nbut the more the full picture of what happened in this case becomes\napparent the more your regimes occupancy and rule over my birthland will\nget to justify. Unless I'm mistaken and this has all been a big\nmisunderstanding and nobody is to blame. But I am not getting much\nreassurance from any of you lot here, that I'm mistaken. I did understand\nyou to have already retired, which was a misunderstanding on my part. Much\nlike I misunderstood the 87 merger of parcels to have occurred in 83 up\nuntil recently. This is a complex case and I don't claim to fully\nunderstand it myself. It will take a village. And I'm here hoping to feel\nmy villages warmth. With some 3 others flying in closely behind me this\nmonth. Legitimacy is the only authority I will recognise here. Two of my\nclose protection officers are both three time decorated gulf war veterans\nand former police and I have passed this to them too. If local authories\nhere won't co-operate, I have no issues using my own security group and\nresources. In Britain and America. I give you local authories here the\nopportunity to answer to what you all did to my family over 40 years.\n\n\nAs you may be able to tell i've near enough abandoned the idea this is a\ndemocracy or any lawful system of government here.  I know the British\nState is a te