er began in military\nintelligence, but we still got nocked into a different life after 1988.\n\n\nMore recently I left my wife and daughter andspend at our villa in the\nCaribbean to spend the time it took me, in a cabin in south Argentina the\nlast year, just to wrap my own head around this case. So while you're all\ntaking your merry old time dragging this out for months, that's the end of\nmy marriage and another family. But I don't know where you all imagine I'm\ngoing each time you all give me the finger?\n\n\nI'm a military warfare professional and I am very  committed to\nunderstanding this. Hence why I just flew 7,000 miles to your doorsteps. If\nthat's my land, how did it come to be you are you all on it? I'm not\nconvinced by the answers you all keep providing. While I was an infant it\nmay have sufficed, or my mum pregnant, my dad terminally ill. But my\ndisabled widow pensioner grandmother  Mary Williams had 7 children, who had\nmany other children, and generation on we now have a small and very hungry\narmy here. I now have more than 50 former soldiers in my US-based private\nsecurity group, with our satellite office here.\n\n\nBut I say this to say my family here are a lot bigger and uglier. And I'm\nnot based here anymore with any of you. I'm resigned to the fact the\nBrit'ish State is ethnically cleansing Welsh Nationals in Wales, which is\nwhy I am now based in Patagonia, Argentina where my AI agents have their\nown legal personhood coming and where us Welsh Nationals and our history\nand heritage is celebrated. I'm only here to light the metaphorical fuse of\nthis powder ceg. The aftermath of it will be between you local authorities\nand all of them. I'm just quietly gathering my evidence, more so for the\nreplica Great House Farm I'm constructing is a museum and third home in\nPatagonia. And if I unravel any fraud, concealment and government\ninvolvement in that process then so be it. The case reopens.\n\n\n https://bpvsbuckler.bucklerfamily.esta