:24:15Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-1a0edc455b623659.txt","threadSlug":"gt-1a0edc455b623659-subject-access-request","scopeTopics":["swp"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["swp"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verified case correspondence); email addresses, phone numbers and private addresses redacted.","threadId":"gt-1a0edc455b623659","direction":"received","from":"Subject Access Requests","institutions":[{"id":"swp","name":"South Wales Police"}],"refs":[],"jsonUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/api/message/gm-1a0edc455b623659.json","textStatus":"available","text":"OFFICIAL SENSITIVE\n\nGood afternoon Requester,\nThank you for your email dated 28/09/2026 that has been fowarded to us to issue a reply to your Subject Access Request.\nPlease note that in order for us to process your request we will need the following:\n\n  *   We require a clear digital photograph of your Identification which may include your Driving Licence, Passport, or a copy of your full birth certificate.\n  *   We require proof of your current address e.g. utility bill / bank statement (dated within the last 3 months).\nThe easiest way for you to submit your request and the required documents is to use the link below.\nThis will ensure that you have provided the relevant information for the Data Protection Team to process your request and that it will be submitted directly to us, rather than to other areas of the force which may cause unnecessary delays.\nAsk for information about yourself | South Wales Police<https://www.south-wales.police.uk/rqo/request/ri/request-information/ir/ask-for-delete-change-information/ask-for-information-about-yourself/?tid=828402&lid=&cid=&rid=5&stepid=1-1-2>\n\nKind regards\n\nTî