 Land Registry (HMLR). Your correspondence and request for an independent review will be passed to an investigation officer here at the ICR Office. They will consider what you have said and discuss your complaint with the Independent Complaints Reviewer.\n\nThe investigation officer will contact you in the next ten working days.\n\nYour referral has been allocated reference number ICR/090/26.\n\nYours sincerely\n\nVicky Applegate\nOffice Administrator\nIndependent Complaints Reviewers Office\n10 South Colonnade\nCanary Wharf\nLondon\n[postcode redacted]\n\n[email redacted]<[email redacted]>\n[phone redacted]"},{"id":"gm-1a0e7d2841902574","subject":"death certificate","name":"death certificate","date":"2026-09-28T11:42:04Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-1a0e7d2841902574.txt","threadSlug":"gt-1a0e7d2841902574-death-certificate","scopeTopics":["vale-foi"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["vale-foi"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verified case correspondence); email addresses, phone numbers and private addresses redacted.","threadId":"gt-1a0e7d2841902574","direction":"received","from":"Jefferies, Hayley","institutions":[{"id":"vale-foi","name":"Vale of Glamorgan Council"}],"refs":[],"jsonUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/api/message/gm-1a0e7d2841902574.json","textStatus":"available","text":"Good afternoon,\n\nI have received your request for a copy certificate for the late Mary Doreen WILLIAMS.\n\nI am struggling to find the record, can you confirm the place and date of death.\n\nMany thanks\n\nHayley\n\nHayley Jefferies\nSuperintendent Registrar/Registration Service Manager\nDemocratic Services\nVale of Glamorgan Council / Cyngor Bro Morgannwg\ntel / ffôn: [phone redacted]\nmob / sym: