a limited\ncompany (03277032)"},{"id":"gm-1a06262f908d733c","subject":"RE: Freedom of Information request - Great House Farm, Llandough, Cardiff (BP vs Buckler 1987) CRM:007302446","name":"RE: Freedom of Information request - Great House Farm, Llandough, Cardiff (BP vs Buckler 1987) CRM:007302446","date":"2026-09-02T13:50:23Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-1a06262f908d733c.txt","threadSlug":"gt-1a06262f908d733c-freedom-of-information-request-great-house-farm-llandough-cardiff-bp-vs-buckler-1987-crm-007302446","scopeTopics":["tna"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["tna"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verified case correspondence); email addresses, phone numbers and private addresses redacted.","threadId":"gt-1a06262f908d733c","direction":"received","from":"FOI Requests","institutions":[{"id":"tna","name":"The National Archives"}],"refs":["CAS-344046","CAS-347296"],"jsonUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/api/message/gm-1a06262f908d733c.json","textStatus":"available","text":"Dear Requester,\n\n\n\nThank you for providing clarification.\n\n\n\nWe have taken your request off hold and we will respond to you by 23/09/2026.\n\n\n\n\nYours sincerely,\n\n\n\nFOI Assessor\nFreedom of Information Centre\n\nThe National Archives\n\n\n\n\n\n------------------- Original Message -------------------\nFrom: [email redacted];\nReceived: Wed Sep 02 2026 05:00:41 GMT+0100 (British Summer Time)\nTo: FOIRequests (TNA)  ; FOI  ; FOI Requests  ; FOI Requests TNA  ; FOI Team Queue  ;\nSubject: Freedom of Information request - Great House Farm, Llandough, Cardiff (BP vs Buckler 1987)\n\n\n\n[You don't often get email from [email redacted]. Learn why this is important at https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification ]\n\nEXTERNAL: This email originates from outside of The National Archives.\n\nDear National Archives,\n\nFOI Centre,\n\nThank you for your email of 20 August 2026 regarding FOI reference CAS-347296-M0V4Y1.\n\nI confirm that the additional material I sent on 20 August 2026 (concerning National Farm Survey / MAFF records and Glamorgan War Agricultural Executive Committee material relating to Great House Farm / Ty Mawr, Llandough, approximately 1936–1950) should be treated as clarification and expansion of the existing FOI request under CAS-347296-M0V4Y1.\n\nPlease also continue to associate it with the earlier case reference CAS-344046-K1S1R2 so that the searches remain coordinated.\n\nIn summary, I am seeking recorded information held by The National Archives concerning:\nExistence, transfer, retention, destruction or disposal of records relating to Great House Farm / Ty Mawr (and earlier descriptions) and associated entities, litigation and administrative processes (as previously detailed).\n\nNational Farm Survey / MAFF records for the holding.\n\nAny Glamorgan CWAEC / War Ag records, possession/requisition orders, cultivation directions, and compensation claims/payments under the Compensation (Defence) Act 1939 or related wartime legislation in respect of the land (or the parcel now associated with Llandough Motor Sales / Llandough Trading Estate), including identity of any compensation recipients.\n\nI am not asking for an open-ended research exercise. I am asking for confirmation of what recorded information (including transfer, accession, disposal or destruction records) is held, the series searched, and the results of those searches.\n\nPlease note that my earlier attempt to send the expansion to [email redacted] failed with a permanent delivery rejection. All further correspondence should use the FOI Centre addresses.\n\nI would be grateful for confirmation that the request is now off hold and for an updated expected response date.\n\nThank you for your assistance.\n\nRegards,\n\nRequester \n\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nPlease use this email address for all replies to this request:\n[email redacted]\n\nIs [email redacted] the wrong address for Freedom of Information requests to National Archives? If so, please contact us using this form:\nhttps://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.whatdotheyknow.com%2Fchange_request%2Fnew%3Fbody%3Dnational_archives&data=05%7C02%7C%7C70785832181d48af3c8108df08a6bcaf%7Cf99512c1fd9f447598969a0b3cdc50ec%7C0%7C0%7C639239184407985002%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=wIqpBe2pC2Zyix5Y4SQGmG0UcKTiwM6rRzGfk6E6hsc%3D&reserved=0 \n\nDisclaimer: This message and any reply that you make will be published on the internet. Our privacy and copyright policies:\nhttps://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.whatdotheyknow.com%2Fhelp%2Fofficers&data=05%7C02%7C%7C70785832181d48af3c8108df08a6bcaf%7Cf99512c1fd9f447598969a0b3cdc50ec%7C0%7C0%7C639239184408011148%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=6yatZVrMN5zY%2BJdj8me7yeBYUN4sSP5SakORwXxmYbI%3D&reserved=0 \n\nFor more detailed guidance on safely disclosing information, read the latest advice from the ICO:\nhttps://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.whatdotheyknow.com%2Fhelp%2Fico-guidance-for-authorities&data=05%7C02%7C%7C70785832181d48af3c8108df08a6bcaf%7Cf99512c1fd9f447598969a0b3cdc50ec%7C0%7C0%7C639239184408030229%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=kkMPobaXnV%2FB37DEhW%2BFex5vhd4YeAyZA49R4B8mzig%3D&reserved=0 \nhttps://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.whatdotheyknow.com%2Fhelp%2Fico-anonymisation-code&data=05%7C02%7C%7C70785832181d48af3c8108df08a6bcaf%7Cf99512c1fd9f447598969a0b3cdc50ec%7C0%7C0%7C639239184408051361%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=oCBGDuiA9Ymg38OEt0bDxVjtLo0jgdSpSk11bWSyFd4%3D&reserved=0 \n\nPlease note that in some cases publication of requests and responses will be delayed.\n\nIf you find this service useful as an FOI officer, please ask your web manager to link to us from your organisation's FOI page.\n\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nPlease don't print this e-mail unless you really need to. ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- National Archives Disclaimer This email and any files transmitted with it are intended solely for the use of the individual(s) to whom they are addressed. If you are not the intended recipient and have received this email in error, please notify the sender and delete the email. Opinions, conclusions and other information in this message and attachments that do not relate to the official business of The National Archives are neither given nor endorsed by it. ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"},{"id":"gm-1a0603fa99788e6d","subject":"New response to your FOI request - BP vs Buckler 1987","name":"New response to your FOI request - BP vs Buckler 1987","date":"2026-09-02T03:52:59Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-1a0603fa99788e6d.txt","threadSlug":"gt-1a0603fa99788e6d-new-response-to-your-foi-request-bp-vs-buckler-1987","scopeTopics":["nactso"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["nactso"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmai