r about 29\n>    May 1990, aged 41; and\n>    - Mary Doreen Williams – born 10 August 1913; death registered in\n>    March 1983, South Glamorgan, Vol. 28, p. 3029.\n>\n> I would be grateful if this could be treated as a formal internal review\n> rather than simply a further general enquiry.\n>\n> I would also ask that the review be undertaken by someone who was not\n> responsible for the original response, where practicable.\n>\n> My purpose is to establish a reliable documentary record and, in\n> particular, to distinguish between:\n>\n> (a) records which do not exist;\n>\n> (b) records which once existed but have been destroyed;\n>\n> (c) records which exist but are held by another organisation; and\n>\n> (d) records which are held within NHS Wales or a predecessor organisation\n> but were not identified by the original search.\n>\n> I would be grateful for confirmation of the review and, where applicable,\n> the relevant FOI reference number.\n>\n> Kind regards,\n>\n> Requester \n>\n> \n>\n>\n>\n> On Fri, 21 Aug 2026, 04:33 SouthWalesCentral MedicalExaminersOffice\n> (Gen126594), <[email redacted]>\n> wrote:\n>\n> Good morning\n>\n>\n>\n> We would not hold any records whatsoever or have any knowledge of these\n> patients.\n>\n>\n>\n> Many thanks\n>\n>\n>\n> Michelle\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n>\n> *Swyddfa Ganolog De Cymru* *South Wales Central Office*\n>\n> *Gwasanaeth Archwilio Meddygol Cymru Gyfan  **All Wales Medical Examiners\n> Service*\n>\n> *Partneriaeth Cydwasanaethau GIG Cymru  **NHS Wales Shared Services\n> Partnership*\n>\n> *Ffon* *Telephone:  [phone redacted]*\n>\n> *E-bost  **Email: **[email redacted]*\n> <[email redacted]>\n>\n> *Gwefan **Website:  *\n> *https://nwssp.nhs.wales/ourservices/medical-examiner-service/*\n> <https://nwssp.nhs.wales/ourservices/medical-examiner-service/>\n>\n>\n>\n> Mae Partneriaeth Cydwasanaethau GIG Cymru yn croesawu gohebiaeth yn y\n> Gymraeg.\n>\n> NHS Wales Shared Services welcomes correspondence in Welsh.\n>\n> Dw i ddim