ad e-bost hwn eu prosesu gan system E-bost Gorfforaethol Cyngor Sir Caerdydd a gallant gael eu harchwilio gan rywun heblaw'r person a enwir.\n**********************************************************************"},{"id":"gm-1a0235910b10a86d","subject":"Re: Enquiry regarding historical deaths – William Buckler (1990) and Mary Doreen Williams (1983)","name":"Re: Enquiry regarding historical deaths – William Buckler (1990) and Mary Doreen Williams (1983)","date":"2026-08-21T08:03:38Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-1a0235910b10a86d.txt","threadSlug":"gt-1a016607283cece4-enquiry-regarding-historical-deaths-william-buckler-1990-and-mary-doreen-williams-1983","scopeTopics":["nhs-cav"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["nhs-cav"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verified case correspondence); email addresses, phone numbers and private addresses redacted.","threadId":"gt-1a016607283cece4","direction":"received","from":"SouthWalesCentral MedicalExaminersOffice (Gen126594)","institutions":[{"id":"nhs-cav","name":"Cardiff and Vale University Health Board"}],"refs":[],"jsonUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/api/message/gm-1a0235910b10a86d.json","textStatus":"available","text":"Apolgies\n\nThe email contact is\n\nNHS Wales Shared Services Partnership (NWSSP)\n4-5 Charnwood Court,\nHeol Billingsley,\nParc Nantgarw,\nCardiff\n[postcode redacted]\n\nTel: [phone redacted]\nEmail: [email redacted] \n\n\nThis department deals with any concerns and enquiries and may be able to direct you in the correct direction\n\nMichelle\n\n\n\n\nSwyddfa Ganolog De Cymru South Wales Central Office\n\nGwasanaeth Archwilio Meddygol Cymru Gyfan  All Wales Medical Examiners Service\n\nPartneriaeth Cydwasanaethau GIG Cymru  