iry regarding historical deaths – William Buckler (1990) and Mary Doreen Williams (1983)\n\nYou don't often get email from [email redacted]. Learn why this is important<https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification>\nWARNING: External email – take care before clicking links or opening attachments.\n\nDear Medical Examiner Service (South Wales Central),\n\nI am writing to enquire whether any records or references are held in relation to the following historical deaths that occurred in the Cardiff & Vale / Llandough area:\n\n1. William (Billy) Buckler\n   - Died at Llandough Hospital on or about 29 May 1990, aged 41\n   - Reported cause: heart attack\n\n2. Mary Doreen Williams\n   - Born 10 August 1913\n   - Death registered March 1983, South Glamorgan (Vol 28, Page 3029)\n\nAlthough these pre-date the current Medical Examiner Service, I would be grateful if you could advise whether any legacy records, referrals, or related documentation exist, or direct me to the appropriate archive or department that may hold such information.\n\nThank you for your assistance.\n\nYours faithfully,\n\nRequester \n"},{"id":"gm-1a022ed5c3971e3e","subject":"Confirm your FOI request to Vale of Glamorgan Council","name":"Confirm your FOI request to Vale of Glamorgan Council","date":"2026-08-21T06:06:15Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-1a022ed5c3971e3e.txt","threadSlug":"gt-1a022ed5c3971e3e-confirm-your-foi-request-to-vale-of-glamorgan-council","scopeTopics":["vale-foi"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["vale-foi"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verified case correspondence); email addresses, phone numbers and private addresses redacted.","threadId":"gt-1a022ed5c3971e3e","direction":"received","from":"(name not show