ite to you in any event.\n>\n> If you have any requirements regarding the format any information should\n> be supplied in, e.g. the language to be used, audio, large print and so on,\n> then if you have not already done so please let us know.\n>\n> If you have any queries or concerns then please do not hesitate to contact\n> us. Please remember to quote the reference number above in any future\n> communications.\n>\n> Further information about your rights is also available from the\n> Information\n> Commissioner at:\n>\n> Information Commissioner's Office - Wales\n>\n> Second Floor, Churchill House\n>\n> Churchill Way,\n>  \n>\n> Cardiff\n>  \n>\n> [postcode redacted]\n>  \n>\n> [phone redacted]\n>\n> [email redacted]\n>\n>\n> Yours sincerely,\n>\n> Information Governance Officer/ Swyddog Llywodraethu Gwybodaeth\n>\n> Director's Office - Resources / Swyddfa'r Cyfarwyddwr - Adnoddau\n>\n> Vale of Glamorgan Council / Cyngor Bro Morgannwg\n>\n> tel / ffôn: [phone redacted]\n>\n> e-mail / e-bost: [email redacted] or\n> [email redacted]\n>\n>\n>\n> *Consider the environment. Please don't print this e-mail unless you\n> really need to.*\n>\n> *Ystyriwch yr amgylchedd. Peidiwch ag argraffu'r neges hon oni bai fod\n> gwir angen.*\n>\n>\n>\n> Visit our Website at www.valeofglamorgan.gov.uk\n>\n> Ewch i'n gwefan yn www.bromorgannwg.gov.uk\n>\n>\n>\n> Find us on Facebook / Cewch ddod o hyd i ni ar Facebook\n>  \n>\n> Follow us on Twitter /Dilynwch ni ar Twitter\n>  \n>\n>\n>\n> Correspondence is welcomed in Welsh or English / Croesewir Gohebiaeth yn y\n> Gymraeg neu yn Saesneg.\n>"},{"id":"gm-19f6102d609a33a6","subject":"FOI/EIR request - Case Ref/ 00211027","name":"FOI/EIR request - Case Ref/ 00211027","date":"2026-07-14T14:23:18Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.e