howch wybod i'r anfonydd ar unwaith os nad ydych chi neu eich cyflogydd yn caniatau e-bost y Rhyngrwyd am negeseuon fel hon. Rhaid deall nad yw'r safbwyntiau, y casgliadau a'r wybodaeth arall yn y neges hon nad ydynt yn cyfeirio at fusnes swyddogol Cyngor Dinas a Sir Caerdydd yn cynrychioli barn y Cyngor Sir nad yn cael sel ei fendith. Caiff unrhyw negeseuon a anfonir at, neu o'r cyfeiriad e-bost hwn eu prosesu gan system E-bost Gorfforaethol Cyngor Sir Caerdydd a gallant gael eu harchwilio gan rywun heblaw'r person a enwir.\n**********************************************************************\n\n\nFrom: Requester <[email redacted]<[email redacted]>>\nSent: 07 June 2026 10:05\nTo: Libraries <[email redacted]<[email redacted]>>\nSubject: Great House Farm, Llandough\n\n EXTERNAL: This email originated from outside Cardiff Council, take care when clicking links.\n ALLANOL: Daw'r e-bost hwn o'r tu allan i Gyngor Caerdydd, cymerwch ofal wrth glicio ar ddolenni.\n\n\n\nSirs,\n\nPlease help me locate a copy of Daniel Thomas/Bute Estates deed/swap for Great House Farm (referenced in quarry deal histories) and any late 1800's / early 1900s materials or Williams family files.\n\nRegards\n\n\n\nRequester"},{"id":"gm-19eca44cf12606a0","subject":"RE: Great House Farm, Williams/ Buckler Family, Llandough, Vale of Glamorgan","name":"RE: Great House Farm, Williams/ Buckler Family, Llandough, Vale of Glamorgan","date":"2026-06-15T07:52:43Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-19eca44cf12606a0.txt","threadSlug":"gt-19ebb2140ec50bbf-great-house-farm-williams-buckler-family-llandough-vale-of-glamorgan","scopeTopics":["vale-foi"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["vale-foi"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verified ca