ce (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-19ebc8496c65273a.txt","threadSlug":"gt-19ebc8496c65273a-automatic-reply-great-house-farm-llandough-now-church-view-close","scopeTopics":["mp"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["mp"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verified case correspondence); email addresses, phone numbers and private addresses redacted.","threadId":"gt-19ebc8496c65273a","direction":"received","from":"DOUGHTY, Stephen","institutions":[{"id":"mp","name":"Member of Parliament"}],"refs":[],"jsonUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/api/message/gm-19ebc8496c65273a.json","textStatus":"available","text":"Hello,\n\nThank you for your email. Please quickly read this automatic response, which serves as notice that your message has been received.\n\nI receive hundreds of emails every week, and although I intend to reply as quickly as I can to all, I prioritise those that raise immediate problems and urgent cases.\n\n\nCasework\n\nThere is a strict protocol that means Members of Parliament may only provide assistance to their own constituents. This means you must live in the constituency of Cardiff South and Penarth in order for me to assist.\n\nPlease therefore ensure that you have included:\n\n• Your full name\n• Your full postal address\n• Your contact telephone number\n• Any relevant reference numbers\n\nParliamentary Business\n\nIf your email relates to my work in Parliament, it will be dealt with as appropriate.\n\nThank you for taking the time to contact me.\n\nYours sincerely,\n\nStephen\n\n[X]\nStephen Doughty MP / AS\nMember of Parliament for Cardiff South and Penarth // Aelod Seneddol dros Dde Caerdydd a Phenarth\nHouse of Commons, Westminster, London, [postcode redacted]\nTel: [phone redacted] | Email: [email redacted]\n\n\nUK Parliament Disclaimer: this e-mail is