 to visit the Library or require any further assistance, please do not hesitate to contact me.\n\nRegards\n\n \n\nRhydian Davies\n\nSwyddog Ystafelloedd Darllen/Reading Rooms Officer\n\nRhif Ffon/Tel No [phone redacted]\n\nAttached Files\n\n-Sources_for_the_History_of_Houses.pdf <https://national-library-wales.libanswers.com/loaderTicket?fid=4450175&type=0&key=a6341c1d39a4789d88d32de76913afb7>\n\n------------------\n\nCwestiwn gwreiddiol\n\nJun 07 2026, 09:54AM via Email\nSubject: Research Enquiry - Great House Farm, Llandough (Williams/Buckler, Bute Estates, Daniel Thomas)\n\nDear Enquiries,\n\nPlease search and advise on/provide access to: Bute Estate collections, maps, title references, family papers, or manuscripts relating to Great House Farm, Llandough; Daniel Thomas quarry deal/swap; John/Mary Williams occupation/ownership claims.\n\nFor generational land history and reparations research. Copies/fees welcome.\n\n\n\n\nRequester\n\n\n------------------\n\nSwyddog Ystafelloedd Darllen/Reading Rooms Officer Ffon/Tel [phone redacted] E-bost/E-mail [email redacted]\n\n\n\nThis email is sent from LibAnswers in relationship to ticket #9541987.\n\nRead our privacy policy. <https://springshare.com/privacy.html>"},{"id":"gm-19ebb2140ec50bbf","subject":"Great House Farm, Williams/ Buckler Family, Llandough, Vale of Glamorgan","name":"Great House Farm, Williams/ Buckler Family, Llandough, Vale of Glamorgan","date":"2026-06-12T09:19:35Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-19ebb2140ec50bbf.txt","threadSlug":"gt-19ebb2140ec50bbf-great-house-farm-williams-buckler-family-llandough-vale-of-glamorgan","scopeTopics":["vale-foi"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["vale-foi"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verif