dd gohebu yn Gymraeg yn arwain at oedi.\n------------------\n\nCwestiwn gwreiddiol\n\nJun 07 2026, 09:54AM via Email\nSubject: Research Enquiry - Great House Farm, Llandough (Williams/Buckler, Bute Estates, Daniel Thomas)\n\nDear Enquiries,\n\nPlease search and advise on/provide access to: Bute Estate collections, maps, title references, family papers, or manuscripts relating to Great House Farm, Llandough; Daniel Thomas quarry deal/swap; John/Mary Williams occupation/ownership claims.\n\nFor generational land history and reparations research. Copies/fees welcome.\n\n\n\n\nRequester\n\n\n------------------\n\n\n\n\nThis email is sent from LibAnswers in relationship to ticket #9541987.\n\nRead our privacy policy. <https://springshare.com/privacy.html>"},{"id":"gm-19ea14bba2b2e7c1","subject":"Subject: FOI - Location & Access to Historical Court Records (Great House Farm, Llandough)","name":"Subject: FOI - Location & Access to Historical Court Records (Great House Farm, Llandough)","date":"2026-06-07T08:55:54Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-19ea14bba2b2e7c1.txt","threadSlug":"gt-19ea14aacd741541-subject-foi-location-access-to-historical-court-records-great-house-farm-llandough","scopeTopics":["moj"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["moj"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verified case correspondence); email addresses, phone numbers and private addresses redacted.","threadId":"gt-19ea14aacd741541","direction":"sent","from":"Requester","institutions":[{"id":"moj","name":"Ministry of Justice / HMCTS"}],"refs":[],"jsonUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/api/message/gm-19ea14bba2b2e7c1.json","textStatus":"available","text":"Please advise on the current location and access options for records of