quested information is held by another public authority, I\nwould be grateful if you could advise which authority is likely to hold the\nrecords.\n\nI would prefer the information in electronic form.\n\nYours faithfully,\n\nRequester Esq. . Heir & Successors of Mary Williams,\nGreat House Farm, Llandough"},{"id":"gm-19e6955728641e0a","subject":"FOI/EIR request - Case Ref/ 00210772","name":"FOI/EIR request - Case Ref/ 00210772","date":"2026-05-27T12:07:44Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-19e6955728641e0a.txt","threadSlug":"gt-19e6955728641e0a-foi-eir-request-case-ref-00210772","scopeTopics":["vale-foi"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["vale-foi"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verified case correspondence); email addresses, phone numbers and private addresses redacted.","threadId":"gt-19e6955728641e0a","direction":"received","from":"(name not shown; valeofglamorgan.gov.uk)","institutions":[{"id":"vale-foi","name":"Vale of Glamorgan Council"}],"refs":["00210772"],"jsonUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/api/message/gm-19e6955728641e0a.json","textStatus":"available","text":"Dear Requester\n\nFREEDOM OF INFORMATION ACT 2000/ENVIRONMENTAL INFORMATION REGULATIONS 2004 - INFORMATION REQUEST\n\nThank you for your request for information about: Great House Farm, Williams/ Buckler Family, Llandough, Vale of Glamorgan\n\nYour request was received on 20/05/2026 and is being considered under the terms of the Freedom of Information Act 2000 and the Environmental Information Regulations 2004. Your query has been given the reference 00210772.\n\nIn some circumstances a fee may be payable and if that is the case we will let you know. A fees notice will be issued to you, and you will be required to pay