o complete and return to HM Land Registry. You will have to return any such completed document by post.\n\n\n\nHM Land Registry's purpose is to protect your land ownership and provide services and data that underpin an efficient and informed property market. Our vision is: \"A world-leading property market as part of a thriving economy and a sustainable future\".\n\nWe check all mail and attachments for known viruses. However, you are advised that you open any attachments at your own risk. If you have received this email and it was not intended for you, please let us know, then delete it.\n\nWe welcome correspondence in English and Welsh.\n\nTo see how HM Land Registry treats your personal information, read our Personal information charter: www.gov.uk/government/organisations/land-registry/about/personal-information-charter.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------\nAttachments (1)\n- Correspondence.pdf (application/pdf, 131 KB): https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/pdf/foi/2026-04-21_hmlr_stage-two-acknowledgement.pdf"},{"id":"gm-19da739612eb15fd","subject":"Automatic reply: Subject: Stage Two Complaint – Title WA231076 – Alleged Mistake in the Register","name":"Automatic reply: Subject: Stage Two Complaint – Title WA231076 – Alleged Mistake in the Register","date":"2026-04-19T19:30:46Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-19da739612eb15fd.txt","threadSlug":"gt-19da73957664dc85-automatic-reply-subject-stage-two-complaint-title-wa231076-alleged-mistake-in-the-register","scopeTopics":["mod"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["mod"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verified case correspondence); email addresses, phone numbers and private addresses redacted.","threadId":"gt-19da73