vidential index etc) if this was to be scoped and reviewed.\n\nI am willing to provide a full indexed evidence pack for confidential review.\n\nKind regards,\n\nRequester\n[phone redacted]\nSganiwyd y neges hon am bob feirws hysbys wrth iddi adael Llywodraeth Cymru. Mae Llywodraeth Cymru yn cymryd o ddifrif yr angen i ddiogelu eich data. Os cysylltwch â Llywodraeth Cymru, mae ein hysbysiad preifatrwydd<”https://gov.wales/about/welsh-government-privacy-notice/?lang=cy”> yn esbonio sut rydym yn defnyddio eich gwybodaeth a sut rydym yn diogelu eich preifatrwydd. Rydym yn croesawu gohebiaeth yn Gymraeg. Byddwn yn anfon ateb yn Gymraeg i ohebiaeth a dderbynnir yn Gymraeg ac ni fydd gohebu yn Gymraeg yn arwain at oedi. ----------------- On leaving the Welsh Government this email was scanned for all known viruses. The Welsh Government takes the protection of your data seriously. If you contact the Welsh Government then our Privacy Notice<https://gov.wales/about/welsh-government-privacy-notice/?lang=en> explains how we use your information and the ways in which we protect your privacy. We welcome receiving correspondence in Welsh. Any correspondence received in Welsh will be answered in Welsh and corresponding in Welsh will not lead to a delay in responding."},{"id":"gm-19a4660862e29ba3","subject":"Enquiry re potential acquiring authority route – former family farmland (BP v Buckler 1987)","name":"Enquiry re potential acquiring authority route – former family farmland (BP v Buckler 1987)","date":"2025-11-02T21:02:02Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-19a4660862e29ba3.txt","threadSlug":"gt-19a465d6eea88bd2-enquiry-re-potential-acquiring-authority-route-former-family-farmland-bp-v-buckler-1987","scopeTopics":["cadw"],"recordType":"correspondence","tag