\nI am willing to provide a full indexed evidence pack for confidential\nreview.\n\nKind regards,\n\nRequester\n[phone redacted]"},{"id":"gm-19a2d116442247c8","subject":"BP vs Buckler 1987 - Documentary","name":"BP vs Buckler 1987 - Documentary","date":"2025-10-28T23:05:04Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted copy of the original email","sourceUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/mail/gm-19a2d116442247c8.txt","threadSlug":"gt-19a2cf51f41ad5bf-bp-vs-buckler-1987-documentary","scopeTopics":["itv"],"recordType":"correspondence","tags":["itv"],"sourcePath":null,"classificationNote":"Ingested from the family's Gmail (verified case correspondence); email addresses, phone numbers and private addresses redacted.","threadId":"gt-19a2cf51f41ad5bf","direction":"sent","from":"Requester","institutions":[{"id":"itv","name":"ITV Archive"}],"refs":[],"jsonUrl":"https://wayback.bucklerfamily.estate/api/message/gm-19a2d116442247c8.json","textStatus":"available","text":"Hi,\n\nI'm exploring doing a documentary about legal case BP Vs Buckler 1987.\n\nI'm the son of the defendant, my late dad William Buckler.\n\nMy last employer and source of income, for my last 22 years in Oath, was\nthe Vale of Glamorgan council.\n\nI have a UK company and would like to make a documentary about this case.\nAnd I'm now seeking co-financeers for this project.\n\nPlease email/ call me if you have interest in this project.\n\nThank you.\n\nRequester\nDirector\nDATRO Consortium Ltd\n[phone redacted]"},{"id":"gm-199b31946d71f259","subject":"Confirm your FOI request to Prime Minister&#39;s Office","name":"Confirm your FOI request to Prime Minister&#39;s Office","date":"2025-10-05T06:40:01Z","dateStatus":"email-date-from-original-message","category":"Case correspondence (original email, redacted)","evidenceVersion":"1.0.0","source":"Wayback case-mail API: redacted 